id: champion-belt
name: Champion Belt
kind: gear
itemType: accessory
craftDC: Master
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Morale Saving Throw 1(bT) higher, and every Personality Skill Check 2 higher, while worn.
text: >
  Champion Belt: A belt of leather and gold indicating a win in a tournament of some kind,
  marking your martial prowess.
  –Craft DC: Master
  –Effects: Increase your Morale Saving Throw by 1(bT) and increase all Skill Checks that
  use your Personality Score by 2.

---

# While worn: "Accessories are Basic Items that can be equipped and apply benefits while
# equipped." Taken off, it does nothing.
[passive]
save.morale += 1(bT);
# "All Skill Checks that use your Personality Score" - by the Attribute, so every Skill it
# governs is caught: Bluff, Cooking, Intimidation, Performance and Persuasion today. On the
# roll, not the Skill Bonus.
skills.personality += 2;
